      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Replace the identity of the original performer with the character defined by <Picture 1>, <Picture 2>, and <Picture 3>. <Video 1> is the source performance reference. Preserve the source shot\u2019s exact timing, acting, body motion, gestures, camera movement, composition, lens perspective, environment, lighting direction, depth of field, wardrobe style, and blocking. Change the performer\u2019s identity to the reference character only. Maintain consistent facial identity, facial proportions, hairstyle, skin tone, age, body proportions, and clothing continuity throughout the entire shot. Photorealistic live-action appearance, natural skin pores and texture, realistic eyes and teeth, natural asymmetry, physically plausible shadows and reflections. Do not beautify, redesign, age, de-age, or change the character. Do not introduce a different face, duplicated limbs, warped hands, temporal flicker, or identity drift. The output must look like the same original shot captured with a different performer.",
        1344,
        768,
        192,
        "max"
      ],
      "title": "H3 R2V \u2014 BF16 MASTER"
    },
