      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "BEST-QUALITY 30-MIN H3 CHARACTER SWAP\n\n1. Work shot-by-shot, never as one 30-minute H3 render. Target 5\u201315 s shots; 8 s is a good default.\n2. Keep H3 at native 24 FPS and use GapFiller only AFTER H3. This preserves every H3-generated frame and creates exact target-timestamp frames for 60 FPS.\n3. Feed the original shot to <Video 1>; feed 3 consistent character references to <Picture 1-3>.\n4. Keep ORIGINAL AUDIO from VHS_LoadVideo and mux it after interpolation.\n5. Do not feed interpolated 60 FPS frames back into H3.\n6. BF16 master settings are intentional for maximum fidelity and require high VRAM/system memory.\n7. Keep the same references and identity description for every shot to reduce identity drift."
      ],
      "title": "READ ME \u2014 LONG VIDEO PIPELINE"
    },
